you're not playing the _latest_ version of nethack!  nethack is at 3.0,
patchlevel 9 and is available via anonymous ftp.

[broken record mode]
ftp to linc.cis.upenn.edu
login: anonymous
password: guest

cd pub/NH3.0/mac	{or pub/NH3.0/amiga, atari, PC, os2}
prompt			{toggle interactive mode}
mget *			{3 files: NH3.09.hqx, NH3.09.doc, README.mac}
quit
[end of record]

the source is available in pub/NH3.0 (strange wrapping) for unix, VMS,
etc. ...

izchak is the name of a much respected dev team member and his name
defaulted to the wizard id (for various reasons).  in later versions
of portable nethacks, the wizard id is either "wizard" or "Wizard"
(should be documented).

mac nethack 3.0 pl9 still has a residual bug so you should save/restore
every few (5) levels or 2,000 moves to avoid problems, however this
should not be a problem in pl10 (release date unknown).  umm, a larger
MultiFinder partition will help some.

